          <p>Healthy habits and consistent care keep smiles shining. We tailor preventive plans to your unique needs and goals.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Comprehensive exams & digital X‑rays</li>
            <li>Gentle cleanings and periodontal therapy</li>
            <li>Fluoride treatments & sealants</li>
            <li>Oral cancer screenings</li>
            <li>Pediatric visits and happy-first checkups</li>
