              <tr><td>Invisalign</td><td>Crooked or crowded teeth</td><td>Clear, removable, and discreet</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Veneers</td><td>Chips, gaps, shape</td><td>Ultra-thin, custom porcelain</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Bonding</td><td>Small chips or spaces</td><td>Same-day resin artistry</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-lg">
          <h2>Cosmetic & Invisalign</h2>
          <p>Preview your new smile with a digital mockup and a step-by-step plan. We’ll show options at different budgets and timelines.</p>
