            <li>Tooth-colored fillings and inlays</li>
            <li>Same-day or lab-crafted crowns</li>
            <li>Implants and implant crowns</li>
            <li>Bridges and partials</li>
            <li>Root canals with modern comfort</li>
          </ul>
