            <li>Split payments for multi‑visit treatment</li>
            <li>All major debit/credit cards and HSA/FSA</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="btn btn-primary mt-4" href="/book.html">Estimate my treatment</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Transparent estimates</h3>
          <p>Before you start, you’ll receive a written estimate showing insurance coverage and your portion. No surprises—ever.</p>
          <div class="accordion mt-4">
