              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4">The best dental experience I’ve ever had—thorough, painless, and so kind. I actually look forward to cleanings now!</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="media">
            <div class="avatar"><img src="/assets/img/avatar-01.svg" alt="Reviewer avatar"></div>
            <div>
              <strong>Sam R.</strong>
              <div class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">
                <svg class="star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 .587l3.668 7.431L24 9.748l-6 5.845L19.335 24 12 19.897 4.665 24 6 15.593 0 9.748l8.332-1.73z"/></svg>
                <svg class="star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 .587l3.668 7.431L24 9.748l-6 5.845L19.335 24 12 19.897 4.665 24 6 15.593 0 9.748l8.332-1.73z"/></svg>
                <svg class="star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 .587l3.668 7.431L24 9.748l-6 5.845L19.335 24 12 19.897 4.665 24 6 15.593 0 9.748l8.332-1.73z"/></svg>
                <svg class="star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 .587l3.668 7.431L24 9.748l-6 5.845L19.335 24 12 19.897 4.665 24 6 15.593 0 9.748l8.332-1.73z"/></svg>
                <svg class="star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 .587l3.668 7.431L24 9.748l-6 5.845L19.335 24 12 19.897 4.665 24 6 15.593 0 9.748l8.332-1.73z"/></svg>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4">They run on time and clearly explain costs. No surprise bills—and my crown looks perfect.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="media">
            <div class="avatar"><img src="/assets/img/avatar-01.svg" alt="Reviewer avatar"></div>
            <div>
              <strong>Avery K.</strong>
              <div class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">
                <svg class="star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 .587l3.668 7.431L24 9.748l-6 5.845L19.335 24 12 19.897 4.665 24 6 15.593 0 9.748l8.332-1.73z"/></svg>
                <svg class="star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 .587l3.668 7.431L24 9.748l-6 5.845L19.335 24 12 19.897 4.665 24 6 15.593 0 9.748l8.332-1.73z"/></svg>
