                <svg class="star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 .587l3.668 7.431L24 9.748l-6 5.845L19.335 24 12 19.897 4.665 24 6 15.593 0 9.748l8.332-1.73z"/></svg>
                <svg class="star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 .587l3.668 7.431L24 9.748l-6 5.845L19.335 24 12 19.897 4.665 24 6 15.593 0 9.748l8.332-1.73z"/></svg>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4">I was nervous, but the team made me feel so comfortable. They explained everything and checked on me often.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-2 mt-8">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Share your feedback</h3>
          <form class="form" data-form="request">
            <div class="field-inline">
              <div>
                <label class="label" for="rv-name">Name</label>
                <input class="input" id="rv-name" name="name" required placeholder="Your name">
